WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:01.945
Why does India have its own nuclear

2
00:00:01.945 --> 00:00:03.094
plan?

3
00:00:03.094 --> 00:00:05.242
Because it has little uranium,

4
00:00:05.242 --> 00:00:07.843
but a great deal of thorium,

5
00:00:07.843 --> 00:00:10.163
sitting in the sands of its beaches.

6
00:00:10.563 --> 00:00:12.978
The catch: thorium can't keep a chain

7
00:00:12.978 --> 00:00:14.859
reaction going by itself.

8
00:00:14.859 --> 00:00:16.263
It first has to be turned into

9
00:00:16.263 --> 00:00:18.760
uranium-233 inside a reactor.

10
00:00:18.760 --> 00:00:21.033
So India planned three steps.

11
00:00:21.433 --> 00:00:24.591
Stage one: pressurised heavy water reactors burn

12
00:00:24.591 --> 00:00:26.646
natural uranium for power,

13
00:00:26.646 --> 00:00:28.771
and leave behind plutonium in their used

14
00:00:28.771 --> 00:00:29.674
fuel.

15
00:00:30.075 --> 00:00:32.954
Stage two: fast breeder reactors burn that

16
00:00:32.954 --> 00:00:34.789
plutonium and breed more fuel than they

17
00:00:34.789 --> 00:00:37.865
use, and later can turn thorium into

18
00:00:37.865 --> 00:00:39.617
uranium-233.

19
00:00:40.016 --> 00:00:42.559
Stage three: reactors that run on thorium

20
00:00:42.559 --> 00:00:45.531
and uranium-233, using India's huge thorium stock

21
00:00:45.531 --> 00:00:46.957
for a very long time.

22
00:00:47.357 --> 00:00:49.006
Homi Bhabha set out the plan in

23
00:00:49.006 --> 00:00:50.492
the nineteen fifties.

24
00:00:50.492 --> 00:00:51.978
Stage one is running,

25
00:00:51.978 --> 00:00:54.567
stage two's first big reactor began loading

26
00:00:54.567 --> 00:00:56.587
fuel in twenty twenty-four,

27
00:00:56.587 --> 00:00:58.617
and stage three is still ahead.

28
00:00:59.017 --> 00:01:00.039
For GS Three,

29
00:01:00.039 --> 00:01:01.258
remember the chain:

30
00:01:01.258 --> 00:01:02.465
heavy water reactors,

31
00:01:02.465 --> 00:01:04.787
then breeders, then thorium.

32
00:01:04.787 --> 00:01:06.656
Each stage makes the fuel for the

33
00:01:06.656 --> 00:01:07.630
next.

